// VF-04A — EMPTY QUEUE COMPONENT REBASE
//
// Operation: ADD ONE STATEMENT to the empty-queue branch of
// btnPR_SelectCurrent.OnSelect (Block 13B formula).
//
// Exact location:
// after the branch clears colPunchReviewFieldsUI / Base / Dirty and sets
// varPunchReviewDirty=false, before the pending-action variables are cleared.
//
// Add:
Reset(cmpPR_CustomFieldValues);

// Reason:
// cmp_CustomFieldValuesPro keeps its own working/base collections. Clearing the
// host Items collection alone does not rebase those internal collections.
// Without this reset, an empty review queue could leave stale values visible
// from the previously selected Punch.
//
// Microsoft documents Reset(ComponentInstance) as the supported way to invoke
// a component's built-in OnReset behavior. VF-03 defines OnReset specifically
// to rebuild the internal working/base tables from Items.
//
// Validation:
// 1. Load a Punch with custom fields.
// 2. Make the review queue empty through the existing test/setup path.
// 3. Trigger btnPR_SelectCurrent.
// 4. The values component must show Empty and no values from the old Punch.
